# Steam gallery of Biotech Bodies (feature 14-gallery): one day of looks at Nelim's Sanctuary.
#
# The block "Sanctuary Backlot" is copied from EntityGazing/Tests/Pickle/wsl-deps.sanctuary.map (itself a copy of
# SanctuaryBacklot/Tests/Pickle/wsl-deps.sanctuary.map, 2026-10-15): bodies, trousers, facial animation set, Show Hair.
# Seeds: Tests/Pickle/config/gallery/ (AB's Visible Pants, Venus Touch Waistlines, Moving Vanilla Eyes; same files as config/sanctuary of the Backlot).
# Added for the gallery (the shotlist, header of 14-gallery.feature): Harmony, WDI Realistic Bodies (already in the block), the four face packs
# (UNAGI, Nice FA, Retexture, Reel), Vanilla Hair Expanded and Roo's HD Hairstyles (canon hair of Miel, Quill, Soren, Ryu, Nelim), then Biotech Bodies last.
# Risk (said in the shotlist): Nice FA is incompatible with Nals.FacialAnimationExperimentals on its own side, and Reel needs VFE Core, VTE and VTE-FA.
# If the game refuses the mix, the shots of the pack that cannot share the map move to a second map (second ticket), the story is unchanged.
#
#   Submit-PickleRun.ps1 -Mod BiotechBodies -DepMap wsl-deps.gallery.map -Filter '@gallery' -EvidenceDir Tests/Pickle/Inbox/gallery
